␀␀␀ISA Tank 3´␀␀␀␀␀MP_L3_Briefing…␀␀␀The battle for the slum quarter of Vekta City saw some of the fiercest fighting of the Helghast attack. Trapped in a maze of alleys, the ISA and Helghast forces gave no quarter and received no quarter.¨␀␀␀␀␀MP_L3_DD_ISAObj4␀␀␀Destroy the Helghast generators and protect our own!≠␀␀␀␀␀MP_L3_DD_HGHObj/␀␀␀Destroy the ISA generators and protect our own!Æ␀␀␀␀␀MP_L3_DD_ISAGen1␀␀␀ISA Generator 1Ø␀␀␀␀␀MP_L3_DD_ISAGen2␀␀␀ISA Generator 2∞␀␀␀␀␀MP_L3_DD_ISAGen3␀␀␀ISA Generator 3±␀␀␀␀␀MP_L3_DD_HGHGen1␀␀␀Helghast Generator 1≤␀␀␀␀␀MP_L3_DD_HGHGen2␀␀␀Helghast Generator 2≥␀␀␀␀␀MP_L3_DD_HGHGen3␀␀␀Helghast Generator 3¥␀␀␀␀␀MP_L4_BriefingÃ␀␀␀The Helghast stormed the ISA Command as they pushed on through Vekta City. Forcing the entrance at the bottom of the Communications Centre, the Helghast fought their way up the core shaft of the building.µ␀␀␀␀␀MP_L4_DD_ISAObj4␀␀␀Destroy the Helghast generators and protect our own!∂␀␀␀␀␀MP_L4_DD_HGHObj/␀␀␀Destroy the ISA generators and protect our own!∑␀␀␀␀␀MP_L4_DD_ISAGen1␀␀␀ISA Generator 1∏␀␀␀␀␀MP_L4_DD_ISAGen2␀␀␀ISA Generator 2π␀␀␀␀␀MP_L4_DD_ISAGen3␀␀␀ISA Generator 3∫␀␀␀␀␀MP_L4_DD_HGHGen1␀␀␀Helghast Generator 1ª␀␀␀␀␀MP_L4_DD_HGHGen2␀␀␀Helghast Generator 2º␀␀␀␀␀MP_L4_DD_HGHGen3␀␀␀Helghast Generator 3Ω␀␀␀␀␀MP_L5_BriefingÓ␀␀␀Of particular importance to the Helghast was the transport network. Targeting the stations, the Helghast sought to reduce the ISA capacity for moving troops and supplies around the city. Realizing their vulnerability, the ISA fought back.æ␀␀␀␀␀MP_L5_ASS_ISAObj␀␀␀Protect the Security System!ø␀␀␀␀␀MP_L5_ASS_HGHObj␀␀␀Destroy the Security System!¿␀␀␀␀␀MP_L5_ASS_ISAConsole1␀␀␀ISA Security Console 1¡␀␀␀␀␀MP_L5_ASS_ISAConsole2␀␀␀ISA Security Console 2¬␀␀␀␀␀MP_L5_ASS_ISAConsole3␀␀␀ISA Security Console 3√␀␀␀␀␀MP_L6_BriefingÚ␀␀␀The Strategic Defense platforms formed the first line of protection against the Helghast invasion. The early neutralization and capture of these platforms would leave Vekta with only ground and air forces to stem the flood of Helghast troops.≈␀␀␀␀␀MP_L7_BriefingÍ␀␀␀The hills and marshes of the Delta to the South of Vekta City were a very attractive landing site for the first Helghast attacks. Caught unprepared, the ISA were compelled to divert forces to the area and prevent the Helghast landing.∆␀␀␀␀␀MP_L7_DD_ISAObj1␀␀␀Destroy the Helghast Tanks and protect our APC's!«␀␀␀␀␀MP_L7_DD_HGHObj,␀␀␀Destroy the ISA APC's and protect our Tanks!»␀␀␀␀␀MP_L7_DD_ISAGun␀␀␀ISA Artillery Gun…␀␀␀␀␀MP_L7_DD_HGHBeacon␀␀␀Helghast Radar Beacon ␀␀␀␀␀MP_L7_ASS_ISAObj␀␀␀Defend our generators!À␀␀␀␀␀MP_L7_ASS_HGHObj␀␀␀Destroy the ISA generatorsÃ␀␀␀␀␀MP_L7_ASS_ISAGun	␀␀␀GeneratorÕ␀␀␀␀␀MP_L8_Briefing·␀␀␀The airborne and overland attacks on Vekta City were soon joined by Helghast naval landings. Surprised by the concentrated attacks, the ISA found themselves fighting on multiple fronts to throw back the Helghast stranglehold.Œ␀␀␀␀␀MP_L8_DD_ISAObj0␀␀␀Destroy the Helghast tanks and protect our APCs!œ␀␀␀␀␀MP_L8_DD_HGHObj/␀␀␀Destroy the ISA vehicles and protect our tanks!—␀␀␀␀␀MP_L8_DD_ISAAPC1
